# Keep local secrets out of the Docker build context, so a manual
# `docker build` on a laptop can't bake them into a published image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.sample
!**/.env.template
**/*.env
**/.my_env*
**/.incorepw
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/.npmrc
**/.pypirc
**/.netrc
**/.pgpass
**/credentials.json
**/*secret*.json
**/*secret*.yaml
**/*secret*.yml
**/*secrets*.zip

# Local tooling that never belongs in an image
.git
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/venv
